1
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,560
He's coming.

2
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,700
(Tilts head)

3
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,480
An elegant lady.

4
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,520
And a handsome gentleman.

5
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,830
Every couple has a different vibe.

6
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,170
This is totally city style.

7
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,050
Seriously.

8
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,720
They're meeting each other halfway.

9
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,040
They're so happy.

10
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:03,320
You look beautiful.

11
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,920
So do you.

12
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,180
(Holding hands)
Feels like we're back on day one.

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,680
Here, my flowers are for you.

14
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,080
I got you flowers too.

15
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:25,980
(Exchanging)

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:26,960
Let's swap.

17
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,200
Thank you.

18
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,080
They're so pretty.

19
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,160
These flowers remind me of you.

20
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,880
They have so many colors.

21
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,800
Colorful, like me.

22
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:36,540
(Nods)

23
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,200
Let's go.

24
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,880
So romantic.

25
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,960
They're "getting married"!

26
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,160
This really feels like a wedding.

27
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,200
Walking down the aisle.

28
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,720
It's only a short walk,

29
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,360
but seriously.

30
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,000
Mr. Yu.

31
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,720
Look at the wording.

32
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,720
Mr. Yu.

33
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,560
Ms. Liang.

34
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:25,260
(Pinches)

35
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,320
He's nervous.

36
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:29,680
I have so much I want to tell you.

37
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:33,040
So I wrote you a letter.

38
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:37,320
(Yu Yang)
And I want to read it to you.

39
00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:39,380
(Excited)

40
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:42,960
I'll put these...

41
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,120
Over here.

42
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,560
So our flowers can be together.

43
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,500
Together.

44
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,660
(Together)
So cute.

45
00:02:57,460 --> 00:02:58,700
(Takes a deep breath)

46
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:01,940
(Holds hand)

47
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:07,920
Hi.

48
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,120
Hi!

49
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,200
Hi.

50
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:11,960
Breaking the ice.

51
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,960
When I first came to the house,

52
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,880
I was actually a little uneasy.

53
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:20,360
It all just felt

54
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,600
too good to be true,

55
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,280
almost like a dream.

56
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,880
It didn't feel quite real.

57
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:33,280
But the more we talked,

58
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:36,680
the more real it started to feel.

59
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,440
I remember you saying

60
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:42,240
that I'm someone

61
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:45,760
who shows more than he says.

62
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,000
When we're together,

63
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,800
you've felt how I care for you.

64
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,800
But honestly,

65
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,160
whether it's through actions or words,

66
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,040
you're better at it than I am.

67
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,380
(Whether it's through actions
or words, you're better at it than I am)

68
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:59,400
Like that time at the beach.

69
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,640
After you took a drink,

70
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:03,360
you instinctively handed me the cup.

71
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,920
When my hair was messy,

72
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:08,160
you'd fix it for me.

73
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,000
When we rested after Muay Thai,

74
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,320
you wiped my sweat.

75
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:14,360
I feel like this past week,

76
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,600
we've slowly

77
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:19,320
gotten used to taking care
of each other.

78
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:20,520
(Liang Renfang)

79
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:22,680
So I hope

80
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,560
you'll give me the chance

81
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,720
to...

82
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:31,160
keep taking care of you.

83
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:34,380
(I hope you'll give me
the chance to keep taking care of you)

84
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,880
Just put this over it.

85
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,720
Let me clean it.

86
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:49,680
Why's your ear bleeding?

87
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,240
Yes.

88
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,200
I hurt it taking off my earring.

89
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,480
I got you some antiseptic.

90
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,840
Thank you.

91
00:04:59,080 --> 00:04:59,920
Good night.

92
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,760
Your lips are a little dry.

93
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,560
Thank you.

94
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:10,790
Oh my gosh.

95
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,160
You...

96
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:16,200
♪Lovers are like children♪

97
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,640
This is way too sweet.

98
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,880
So sweet.

99
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,480
You always have

100
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:30,000
such a bright, happy

101
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,520
smile on your face.

102
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:33,480
But

103
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:36,120
that night at the beach,

104
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,200
when I saw you cry,

105
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,320
I felt like

106
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,680
I saw another side of you.

107
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:48,880
You're crying?

108
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:56,000
Tears of joy.

109
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,120
You asked if I could accept

110
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:03,400
those little moods
that come for no reason.

111
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,480
He remembered all of it.

112
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,640
What I really want to say is,

113
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:11,160
no one's happy all the time.

114
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,400
Your happy side is you,

115
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,640
and your angry side is you too.

116
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,480
I hope I get to see

117
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,680
more sides of you around me.

118
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:25,240
It means you're opening up

119
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,920
to me completely.

120
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,740
(You're opening up to me completely)

121
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,560
He's so gentle. Seriously.

122
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,840
That was so well said.

123
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:37,040
Then, at the beach,

124
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,280
we talked about our families

125
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:42,120
and how our parents get along.

126
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,280
At the dinosaur restaurant,

127
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:45,520
you told me about your friends.

128
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,720
Then, on the way back to the house,

129
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,800
you said you wanted to introduce

130
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,720
your siblings to me.

131
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:56,320
I just want to say I really...

132
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,440
really look forward to meeting them.

133
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,200
So...

134
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:05,980
(Folds it)

135
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,560
Liang Renfang,

136
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,720
my girlfriend.

137
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,520
Would you like to

138
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,520
be my girlfriend

139
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:20,600
and face the world together?

140
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:33,600
I would.

141
00:07:33,740 --> 00:07:35,540
(I would)

142
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:42,380
(I would)

143
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,640
I'm so happy for them.

144
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:08,580
(Pats)

145
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:11,040
You're pretty expressive today.

146
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,720
Really?

147
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:15,080
You always say you're bad
at expressing yourself,

148
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,440
but you always do it so well.

149
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,080
Can I hold your hand while I say this?

150
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:21,800
Sure.

151
00:08:24,580 --> 00:08:26,260
(Holds tightly)

152
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,720
First, I feel so lucky

153
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,960
to have met you.

154
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:40,280
You once said at the Blue Space

155
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,160
that

156
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:44,360
love is being on the same wavelength.

157
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,800
You don't need many words

158
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:49,400
for the other person to understand.

159
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
Like when we were at the beach,

160
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,840
I suddenly started crying.

161
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,880
But you didn't panic

162
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,800
and keep asking what was wrong.

163
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,520
You just took my hand

164
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,600
and held it tight.

165
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,280
You quietly stayed with me.

166
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:09,440
You made me feel

167
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:14,080
so safe and grounded.

168
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:18,560
Like you'd always be there.

169
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:20,740
(That sense of safety made me
feel like you'd always be there)

170
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,080
He's touched.

171
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,120
That's beautiful.

172
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,880
I once posted on Moments,

173
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:35,960
saying

174
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,160
I hoped there'd be

175
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,280
someone in this world

176
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,640
who'd understand my childish side

177
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:42,320
and protect my innocence.

178
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,680
Because to me,

179
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,440
that

180
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,560
is something really rare.

181
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:52,440
But some people don't think

182
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:54,880
it's something worth cherishing.

183
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:55,680
They think

184
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:57,520
it means you haven't grown up.

185
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,320
Like my parents sometimes.

186
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,800
They'll often say,

187
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:03,320
"Can't you be more mature?"

188
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,720
"Can't you stop acting like a kid?"

189
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,280
But that day in the car,

190
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,360
you told me

191
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,480
you liked my childish side.

192
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:17,800
You hoped I'd always keep it.

193
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,040
And

194
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,360
after everything I've been through,

195
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,320
still having that innocence

196
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,080
is something...

197
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,040
Really precious.

198
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,360
Feeling seen.

199
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,860
(Keeping that innocence
is something really precious)

200
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,360
And that's when I realized

201
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:42,720
there really
is someone who understands me

202
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:46,440
and can protect

203
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,480
this childish side of me.

204
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:53,560
I feel incredibly lucky and happy.

205
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,720
I'm lucky too.

206
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:58,480
With you around,

207
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,840
I feel so secure.

208
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:04,000
You're like my anchor.

209
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,520
Like you'll always catch me.

210
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,360
It makes me feel

211
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:10,760
like I'm becoming
a better person with you.

212
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:13,760
You've helped me find myself again

213
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:18,080
and given me
the confidence to truly say,

214
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,400
"I deserve to be loved."

215
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:23,660
(You've given me the confidence
to truly say "I deserve to be loved")

216
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:35,080
I think when you're with me,

217
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:36,440
your inner child comes out more.

218
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,520
Let me pick it out for you.

219
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:40,120
Come here.

220
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,800
So thoughtful.

221
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,080
Water festival.

222
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,160
Why are you just like me?

223
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:54,280
Rose and Jack.

224
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:58,160
Ice cream.

225
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,600
Let's have some ice cream.

226
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,920
I want some.

227
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,800
Okay.

228
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,240
I think I can actually
put my feet in today.

229
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:10,380
(Excited)

230
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,720
Okay, never mind.

231
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,440
Got it.

232
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,960
You have to hold onto me.

233
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,600
And I'll

234
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:27,200
be the rock

235
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:30,160
you can always lean on.

236
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:34,000
Then I'll be your lighthouse.

237
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,360
I'll point the way.

238
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:37,120
Aww...

239
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,560
This is happiness.

240
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,520
You two!

241
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,280
Last time,

242
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,200
when I sang Slowly Falling for You,

243
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:57,080
I was too shy to look you in the eyes.

244
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,480
But today, I want

245
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,920
to sing Slowly Falling for You,

246
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,040
to you.

247
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,120
I'll clap first.

248
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,400
I'll come a little closer.

249
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:14,940
(Moves closer)

250
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:17,640
She's so cute.

251
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:23,200
♪Slowly falling for you♪

252
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,960
♪Slowly growing closer♪

253
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,600
Sounds great.

254
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,320
♪Slowly sharing ourselves♪

255
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:31,040
♪Slowly walking side by side♪

256
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:33,680
♪Slowly learning your rhythm♪

257
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:36,600
♪Slowly giving you my heart♪

258
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:38,320
♪Slowly staying by your side♪

259
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:41,360
♪Slowly growing old together♪

260
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:47,840
♪Because taking it slow is the best♪

261
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,300
♪Reason♪

262
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:54,940
(Slowly falling for you)

263
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,600
Yu Yang's heart is pounding like a drum.

264
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,560
His heartbeat's all over the place now.

265
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:32,100
(Glasses fog up)

266
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:33,720
Why'd they fog up?

267
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,360
They fogged up.

268
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,880
He's moved.

269
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,560
That really got him.

270
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:47,280
I actually have another gift for you.

271
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,840
The gift I prepared is in Beijing.

272
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:52,980
(Little butterfly necklace)

273
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,200
This butterfly...

274
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,360
It's like the one

275
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:04,000
you mentioned in your message.

276
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:06,620
(Fang to Yu Yang:
Hope you sleep well every night)

277
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:07,920
He remembered.

278
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:10,040
He's so thoughtful.

279
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,960
Can I put it on you?

280
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,000
Sure.

281
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:26,400
So pretty.

282
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:27,440
It's beautiful.

283
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:29,320
It goes perfectly with my outfit.

284
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,120
Yeah.

285
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,360
I'll show it off.

286
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,360
Wow.

287
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:16,520
They're such a lovely couple.

288
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,920
So sweet.

289
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:36,340
(So sweet)

290
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,720
He's calling it sweet himself.

291
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,680
I can't with this.

292
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,840
Yu Yang, you lucky guy.

293
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:48,080
From now on...

294
