1156
00:54:07,120 --> 00:54:08,320
This is still for you.

1157
00:54:09,720 --> 00:54:11,840
I chose the pink ticket.

1158
00:54:11,840 --> 00:54:14,240
I really want to know more about you.

1159
00:54:14,440 --> 00:54:15,320
I'm glad I fell

1160
00:54:15,320 --> 00:54:16,120
for you.

1161
00:54:16,120 --> 00:54:18,580
(Falling for you was worth it)

1162
00:54:19,320 --> 00:54:20,920
All I could think was how quickly

1163
00:54:21,240 --> 00:54:22,360
time was passing.

1164
00:54:22,360 --> 00:54:24,840
If I didn't make the most of it,

1165
00:54:24,840 --> 00:54:25,840
I might lose

1166
00:54:26,280 --> 00:54:28,760
the chance to keep getting to know you.

1167
00:54:28,860 --> 00:54:35,540
(Afraid time would slip away
before he could get any closer)

1168
00:54:44,440 --> 00:54:45,240
And...

1169
00:54:45,800 --> 00:54:46,640
I'm getting a little mixed up.

1170
00:54:46,640 --> 00:54:48,080
I don't even know where I left off.

1171
00:54:48,080 --> 00:54:48,960
(Nervous)

1172
00:54:48,960 --> 00:54:50,240
It's okay.

1173
00:54:50,240 --> 00:54:51,160
Take your time.

1174
00:54:51,800 --> 00:54:52,920
I think my most

1175
00:54:53,000 --> 00:54:54,800
unforgettable day here in Thailand

1176
00:54:54,800 --> 00:54:56,480
was when we went

1177
00:54:56,480 --> 00:54:58,680
horseback riding on the beach

1178
00:54:58,680 --> 00:55:00,000
and watched the sunset.

1179
00:55:02,760 --> 00:55:04,280
I hope that

1180
00:55:04,280 --> 00:55:06,080
if we ever get the chance,

1181
00:55:06,880 --> 00:55:07,960
I can be there

1182
00:55:07,960 --> 00:55:09,720
to share it all with you.

1183
00:55:11,120 --> 00:55:13,800
I've always been sure of how I feel.

1184
00:55:13,800 --> 00:55:18,180
(I've always been sure of how I feel)

1185
00:55:18,180 --> 00:55:19,460
(Sha Yue'er)

1186
00:55:19,800 --> 00:55:21,760
I'd like to be your satellite.

1187
00:55:21,760 --> 00:55:24,260
(I'd like to be your satellite)

1188
00:55:25,720 --> 00:55:27,000
That was beautiful.

1189
00:55:27,640 --> 00:55:28,720
You don't always

1190
00:55:29,440 --> 00:55:30,280
have to know

1191
00:55:30,600 --> 00:55:31,880
exactly where I am

1192
00:55:32,120 --> 00:55:32,960
or keep checking

1193
00:55:33,360 --> 00:55:34,600
if I'm still there.

1194
00:55:35,000 --> 00:55:36,280
But whenever you need me,

1195
00:55:36,280 --> 00:55:38,000
just look up and you'll see me.

1196
00:55:38,020 --> 00:55:40,300
(Just look up and you'll see me)

1197
00:55:40,320 --> 00:55:41,600
That really carries a lot of weight.

1198
00:55:41,600 --> 00:55:42,880
It's really touching.

1199
00:55:42,880 --> 00:55:43,920
Yeah.

1200
00:55:50,600 --> 00:55:51,400
Sha Yue'er.

1201
00:55:54,960 --> 00:55:56,040
I like you.

1202
00:55:56,060 --> 00:56:02,420
(Sha Yue'er, I like you)

1203
00:56:27,440 --> 00:56:28,280
Okay.

1204
00:56:28,280 --> 00:56:29,440
Thank you.

1205
00:57:24,880 --> 00:57:25,420
Hello.

1206
00:57:25,940 --> 00:57:27,000
Hello.

1207
00:57:27,000 --> 00:57:28,400
We've met before. Did you forget?

1208
00:57:28,760 --> 00:57:29,640
Right.

1209
00:57:29,640 --> 00:57:30,480
I'm...

1210
00:57:30,640 --> 00:57:32,000
Do you actually remember me?

1211
00:57:32,000 --> 00:57:33,600
Of course I do.

1212
00:57:33,880 --> 00:57:35,480
Do you know when my birthday is?

1213
00:57:35,760 --> 00:57:36,560
July 17th.

1214
00:57:36,560 --> 00:57:38,120
I remember you like

1215
00:57:38,120 --> 00:57:39,920
lychees, cherries, and mangoes.

1216
00:57:41,280 --> 00:57:41,880
Hello.

1217
00:57:42,440 --> 00:57:43,480
How many suitcases do you have?

1218
00:57:43,480 --> 00:57:44,200
One.

1219
00:57:45,080 --> 00:57:45,560
Okay.

1220
00:57:46,800 --> 00:57:47,880
I brought your suitcase up for you.

1221
00:57:48,640 --> 00:57:49,360
Thanks.

1222
00:57:50,120 --> 00:57:51,520
I can tell right away
Sha Yue'er made this.

1223
00:57:51,800 --> 00:57:52,720
Why?

1224
00:57:53,040 --> 00:57:54,720
Because you've been
dropping hints since day one.

1225
00:57:55,640 --> 00:57:56,920
You have to sear it first, then cook it.

1226
00:57:58,280 --> 00:57:59,720
Your signature dish is braised fish.

1227
00:58:00,560 --> 00:58:02,320
But you have to fry it
before braising it.

1228
00:58:02,900 --> 00:58:04,380
(Takes note)

1229
00:58:04,600 --> 00:58:06,620
Are you cutting the chicken thigh
into cubes?

1230
00:58:06,920 --> 00:58:07,760
Yeah.

1231
00:58:07,760 --> 00:58:09,160
I still need to skin and debone it.

1232
00:58:10,240 --> 00:58:11,360
I'll remove the skin.

1233
00:58:11,680 --> 00:58:13,640
The bottom looks pretty funny.

1234
00:58:13,640 --> 00:58:14,320
Does it look okay?

1235
00:58:14,320 --> 00:58:15,520
It's almost perfect.

1236
00:58:15,520 --> 00:58:16,440
Really?

1237
00:58:16,440 --> 00:58:17,720
I'm freezing to death.

1238
00:58:17,720 --> 00:58:19,320
Want me to make you some turmeric tea?

1239
00:58:19,320 --> 00:58:20,000
Sure.

1240
00:58:20,760 --> 00:58:22,400
I'll catch you.

1241
00:58:22,400 --> 00:58:23,320
Okay!

1242
00:58:23,380 --> 00:58:24,720
(Under professional supervision.
Do not imitate.)

1243
00:58:24,720 --> 00:58:26,000
Don't be scared. I'm right here.

1244
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:27,640
(Helps ease her fear)
You got this, Sha Yue'er!

1245
00:58:29,360 --> 00:58:31,240
Bittersweet.

1246
00:58:31,240 --> 00:58:32,960
But even bittersweet
still has sweetness in it.

1247
00:58:32,960 --> 00:58:34,660
(Even bittersweet still
has sweetness in it)

1248
00:58:35,040 --> 00:58:36,920
This is us at 22.

1249
00:58:36,920 --> 00:58:38,440
And our 22 has been beautiful,

1250
00:58:38,440 --> 00:58:38,960
hasn't it?

1251
00:58:38,960 --> 00:58:41,080
(Our 22 has been beautiful)
We're all on our way to happier days.

1252
00:58:42,280 --> 00:58:43,160
Be careful.

1253
00:58:44,680 --> 00:58:45,760
The light's in your eyes.

1254
00:58:45,820 --> 00:58:47,140
(Blocks the light)

1255
00:58:47,880 --> 00:58:48,960
So beautiful.

1256
00:58:49,880 --> 00:58:50,920
I'll hold on to you.

1257
00:58:52,080 --> 00:58:53,120
Is this pace okay?

1258
00:58:53,120 --> 00:58:53,760
Yeah, I'm good.

1259
00:58:53,760 --> 00:58:55,480
Thank you. You're such a nice guy.

1260
00:58:56,480 --> 00:58:58,480
You got to see me cry.

1261
00:58:58,480 --> 00:59:00,120
If you're willing to cry in front of me,

1262
00:59:00,120 --> 00:59:01,320
it means you really trust me.

1263
00:59:01,320 --> 00:59:03,320
I've always wanted to see
the other side of the moon.

1264
00:59:03,320 --> 00:59:04,920
And now I finally have.

1265
00:59:18,240 --> 00:59:19,240
I'll go.

1266
00:59:20,200 --> 00:59:22,320
Describe her in three words,

1267
00:59:22,320 --> 00:59:23,760
based on the little things
you've noticed about her.

1268
00:59:23,760 --> 00:59:24,720
Graceful.

1269
00:59:24,720 --> 00:59:27,400
She smiles a lot.

1270
00:59:27,400 --> 00:59:28,640
And practical.

1271
00:59:28,880 --> 00:59:29,720
And practical.

1272
00:59:31,320 --> 00:59:32,520
You know I'm pretty direct.

1273
00:59:32,520 --> 00:59:34,060
I don't know what your approach is.

1274
00:59:34,060 --> 00:59:34,690
But it doesn't matter.

1275
00:59:34,690 --> 00:59:36,320
Everyone deserves a fair
chance to get to know each other,

1276
00:59:36,320 --> 00:59:37,360
so I want to get to know you too.

1277
00:59:37,360 --> 00:59:38,720
Whose name did you write first?

1278
00:59:38,720 --> 00:59:40,600
It had to be you.

1279
00:59:40,600 --> 00:59:41,280
But my choice

1280
00:59:41,280 --> 00:59:42,320
has never changed.

1281
00:59:42,320 --> 00:59:43,200
Not once.

1282
00:59:43,640 --> 00:59:45,320
Why is it you again?

1283
00:59:45,320 --> 00:59:46,850
(Hands her the card)
This is for you.

1284
00:59:46,880 --> 00:59:47,800
Surprised?

1285
00:59:47,800 --> 00:59:48,720
Very.

1286
00:59:48,720 --> 00:59:49,600
What's wrong with that?

1287
00:59:49,600 --> 00:59:50,840
Life needs

1288
00:59:50,840 --> 00:59:53,120
a few surprises like me.

1289
00:59:54,080 --> 00:59:54,840
I can be a little

1290
00:59:54,840 --> 00:59:56,200
difficult sometimes.

1291
00:59:56,200 --> 00:59:57,560
(I can be a little difficult sometimes)
Go ahead.

1292
00:59:57,560 --> 00:59:59,260
(Go ahead)

1293
00:59:59,320 --> 01:00:01,400
If you jumped first,

1294
01:00:01,400 --> 01:00:03,120
I'd jump right after you.

1295
01:00:03,520 --> 01:00:04,760
I think I'm getting a little dizzy.

1296
01:00:05,120 --> 01:00:06,120
(Hands her medicine)
Take half.

1297
01:00:06,120 --> 01:00:07,240
Thanks.

1298
01:00:08,560 --> 01:00:09,600
I have a little fan.

1299
01:00:09,600 --> 01:00:10,400
I'll cool you down.

1300
01:00:10,540 --> 01:00:11,320
I bought it especially for you.

1301
01:00:13,800 --> 01:00:15,080
I just don't want you
to overthink things.

1302
01:00:15,080 --> 01:00:16,000
It's happened before,

1303
01:00:16,000 --> 01:00:17,160
and I don't want that to happen again.

1304
01:00:20,080 --> 01:00:22,320
Sha Yue'er must be really torn right now.

1305
01:00:22,680 --> 01:00:24,400
Torn and conflicted.

1306
01:00:25,100 --> 01:00:28,700
(Guess Sha Yue'er's final choice)

1307
01:00:28,840 --> 01:00:29,960
Dear Cupids,

1308
01:00:29,960 --> 01:00:31,440
we've

1309
01:00:31,440 --> 01:00:32,560
now reached

1310
01:00:32,560 --> 01:00:33,640
our final prediction

1311
01:00:33,640 --> 01:00:35,600
(Final prediction of the season)
of the season.

1312
01:00:35,600 --> 01:00:37,520
This time, we're doing it as a team.

1313
01:00:37,520 --> 01:00:38,520
As a team.

1314
01:00:38,520 --> 01:00:39,720
We'll discuss it together

1315
01:00:39,720 --> 01:00:40,560
and come to one decision.

1316
01:00:40,720 --> 01:00:41,360
Guys,

1317
01:00:41,360 --> 01:00:41,880
just a reminder,

1318
01:00:41,880 --> 01:00:42,900
I'm only one Heart Stone away.

1319
01:00:42,900 --> 01:00:44,300
(One more Heart Stone to unlock a wish)
Then we can make a wish together.

1320
01:00:44,300 --> 01:00:44,960
Right.

1321
01:00:46,840 --> 01:00:47,240
Guys.

1322
01:00:47,600 --> 01:00:48,320
This is important.

1323
01:00:49,000 --> 01:00:50,120
All right, everyone.

1324
01:00:50,120 --> 01:00:51,640
So who will

1325
01:00:51,640 --> 01:00:53,680
Sha Yue'er choose?

1326
01:00:53,680 --> 01:00:54,520
(Sha Yue'er, Chen Hewen, Zhao Xilun)

1327
01:00:54,520 --> 01:00:55,600
I think it's Zhao Xilun.

1328
01:00:55,600 --> 01:00:56,560
(Sha Yue'er, Zhao Xilun)
I think it's Zhao Xilun too.

1329
01:00:56,560 --> 01:00:57,480
(Disagrees)
I think it's Chen Hewen.

1330
01:00:57,480 --> 01:00:58,160
At first,

1331
01:00:58,160 --> 01:00:59,320
Chen Hewen definitely had the upper hand

1332
01:00:59,320 --> 01:01:00,280
in Sha Yue'er's heart.

1333
01:01:00,280 --> 01:01:02,980
But gradually,
that spark started to fade.

1334
01:01:02,980 --> 01:01:03,690
He didn't seize his chance.

1335
01:01:03,690 --> 01:01:04,760
Zhao Xilun started to win her over.

1336
01:01:04,760 --> 01:01:06,160
(Another take)
She's torn between them.

1337
01:01:06,160 --> 01:01:06,960
And if she's torn

1338
01:01:06,960 --> 01:01:08,240
between two people,

1339
01:01:09,000 --> 01:01:09,640
I think

1340
01:01:09,640 --> 01:01:11,280
she might go back to the one

1341
01:01:11,280 --> 01:01:12,720
who first made her heart race.

1342
01:01:12,720 --> 01:01:13,680
For Sha Yue'er,

1343
01:01:13,680 --> 01:01:14,440
Chen Hewen was definitely

1344
01:01:14,440 --> 01:01:16,000
that instant, physical attraction.

1345
01:01:17,240 --> 01:01:18,360
But judging by

1346
01:01:18,360 --> 01:01:20,400
how Sha Yue'er

1347
01:01:20,400 --> 01:01:20,920
reacted

1348
01:01:20,920 --> 01:01:22,320
to Zhao Xilun's confession,

1349
01:01:22,320 --> 01:01:23,840
she smiled a lot more.

1350
01:01:24,440 --> 01:01:27,000
Chen Hewen was who she once thought

1351
01:01:27,000 --> 01:01:29,520
she wanted,

1352
01:01:29,520 --> 01:01:30,760
but now,

1353
01:01:30,760 --> 01:01:31,960
she thinks it's...

1354
01:01:31,960 --> 01:01:32,640
Zhao Xilun.

1355
01:01:32,640 --> 01:01:33,600
To be honest,

1356
01:01:33,600 --> 01:01:35,320
before all this,

1357
01:01:35,320 --> 01:01:37,880
I was sure
Sha Yue'er would choose Chen Hewen.

1358
01:01:37,880 --> 01:01:39,600
But after all those ups and downs,

1359
01:01:39,600 --> 01:01:41,560
Zhao Xilun kept moving forward
one step at a time.

1360
01:01:41,560 --> 01:01:42,560
One step at a time.

1361
01:01:43,480 --> 01:01:45,000
Still, deep down, I feel like

1362
01:01:45,000 --> 01:01:46,160
her final choice

1363
01:01:47,680 --> 01:01:48,440
will be Chen Hewen.

1364
01:01:48,520 --> 01:01:49,200
Really?

1365
01:01:49,200 --> 01:01:50,480
I just think when your heart

1366
01:01:50,480 --> 01:01:52,200
is drawn to someone,

1367
01:01:52,200 --> 01:01:53,640
there isn't always a reason for it.

1368
01:01:53,920 --> 01:01:55,560
After the Couples House,

1369
01:01:55,560 --> 01:01:57,080
I think Zhao Xilun really

1370
01:01:57,080 --> 01:01:58,920
made an impact on Sha Yue'er.

1371
01:01:58,920 --> 01:02:00,120
And at the very end,

1372
01:02:00,120 --> 01:02:00,960
he really

1373
01:02:00,960 --> 01:02:02,080
moved her.

1374
01:02:02,080 --> 01:02:02,720
Right.

1375
01:02:02,720 --> 01:02:04,160
Especially when she told Zhao Xilun

1376
01:02:04,160 --> 01:02:05,120
she hated seeing him cry

1377
01:02:05,120 --> 01:02:06,200
and didn't want to see him hurt.

1378
01:02:06,200 --> 01:02:07,920
Zhao Xilun definitely touched her heart.

1379
01:02:07,920 --> 01:02:08,880
I just still think

1380
01:02:08,880 --> 01:02:10,360
Sha Yue'er will choose Chen Hewen.

1381
01:02:10,360 --> 01:02:11,600
No.

1382
01:02:14,160 --> 01:02:15,000
How do we decide?

1383
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:15,800
Let's vote.

1384
01:02:15,800 --> 01:02:17,320
(Straight to the vote)
Raise your hand for Zhao Xilun.

1385
01:02:18,620 --> 01:02:20,020
(Four choose Sha Yue'er, Zhao Xilun)

1386
01:02:20,040 --> 01:02:21,440
Raise your hand for Chen Hewen.

1387
01:02:21,440 --> 01:02:22,940
(Two choose Sha Yue'er, Chen Hewen)

1388
01:02:25,340 --> 01:02:28,380
(The Cupids' final prediction:
Sha Yue'er, Zhao Xilun)

1389
01:02:28,520 --> 01:02:29,200
All right.

1390
01:02:29,200 --> 01:02:30,240
So who

1391
01:02:30,240 --> 01:02:31,520
will Sha Yue'er

1392
01:02:31,520 --> 01:02:32,520
ultimately choose?

1393
01:02:32,760 --> 01:02:34,280
Master Kong Jasmine Tea.

1394
01:02:34,280 --> 01:02:36,160
Every sip is as fragrant
as the first blossom.

1395
01:02:36,160 --> 01:02:37,240
Now it's time

1396
01:02:37,240 --> 01:02:38,880
for the Jasmine Heart-Flutter Moment.

1397
01:02:38,880 --> 01:02:41,000
Let's reveal the answer.

1398
01:02:49,240 --> 01:02:50,480
I'm so nervous.

1399
01:02:54,760 --> 01:02:56,160
My heart's beating so fast.

1400
01:03:18,240 --> 01:03:19,240
Who is it?

1401
01:03:19,520 --> 01:03:20,160
I'm nervous.

1402
01:03:27,200 --> 01:03:28,080
Who?

1403
01:03:30,420 --> 01:03:32,660
(Who will Sha Yue'er ultimately choose?)
Oh my gosh.

1404
01:03:32,660 --> 01:03:37,140
(Next episode)

1405
01:03:37,160 --> 01:03:38,240
I'm so nervous.

1406
01:03:39,000 --> 01:03:39,840
Who is it?

1407
01:03:41,080 --> 01:03:42,720
I don't know why,
but whenever I see you,

1408
01:03:42,720 --> 01:03:44,200
I can't help but smile.

1409
01:03:52,400 --> 01:03:54,120
It's all star-themed.

1410
01:03:54,320 --> 01:03:54,920
That's so romantic.

1411
01:03:55,360 --> 01:03:56,480
I just feel like my confession...

1412
01:03:56,920 --> 01:03:57,560
came too late.

1413
01:03:59,600 --> 01:04:01,440
Can I be the one who stays

1414
01:04:01,440 --> 01:04:03,440
by your side through life?

1415
01:04:09,200 --> 01:04:10,120
Got it on camera.

1416
01:04:12,040 --> 01:04:14,400
After all the hardships,
I finally found you.

1417
01:04:14,400 --> 01:04:16,220
(After all the hardships,
I finally found you)

1418
01:04:16,220 --> 01:04:31,620
(Heart Signal (China Version) S9,
Finale Schedule)

1419
01:04:42,840 --> 01:04:45,560
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

1420
01:04:45,560 --> 01:04:48,160
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

1421
01:04:48,160 --> 01:04:52,360
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

1422
01:04:53,520 --> 01:04:56,240
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

1423
01:04:56,240 --> 01:04:58,880
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

1424
01:04:58,880 --> 01:05:02,960
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

1425
01:05:03,680 --> 01:05:05,080
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

1426
01:05:05,080 --> 01:05:06,400
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

